= California University of Science and Medicine - Prompt 01

#section_label("Prompt metadata")
- Title: Diversity Contribution
- Limit: 150 words
- Cycle used in this repo: 2025-2026 from Admit.org / Med School Insiders
- Source: https://med.admit.org/secondary-essays/california-university-of-science-and-medicine
